{"id":"854772391cef4007","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-sentence.md","title":"Sentence","display":"df-sentence — Sentence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-sentence","aliases":["67-df-sentence"],"display":"df-sentence — Sentence","depends_on":["[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-syntax-interface]]"],"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_scope":"本册形式语言接口；原书第1章pp.5–10，PDF16–21的记号对应，不声称逐字定义","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"inherited_verification_status":"local-interface-checked","source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sentence — Sentence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f06c9fe86c236dd\" href=\"?note=3f06c9fe86c236dd\" title=\"67-df-syntax-interface\">67-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"本册形式语言接口；原书第1章pp.5–10，PDF16–21的记号对应，不声称逐字定义"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-interface-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{free}_L\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a> 的同一有限树语法与自由变量递归。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 是下式定义的句子集合；未限制公式是否可判定，使用有效性时另行声明。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L:\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L:\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>原书 p.5 使用通常的一阶句法。本册形式实现复用第90册桥接到第88册的相同公式树及自由变量函数，故没有仅凭同名 Fml 混接两个不同语法。派生联结词与存在量词按第90册定义展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"3f06c9fe86c236dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为签名，$\\mathrm{Fml}_L$、$\\mathrm{free}_L$ 取 [[67-df-formula]] 的同一有限树语法与自由变量递归。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L:\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1517,"backlinks":[{"id":"fea02b696529d019","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d59b0b327715a4b0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 是固定有效一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 是公理集合；句子见 [[67-df-sentence]]，$T\\vdash\\varphi$ 使用固定完整一阶演算的可推导性，见 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。"},{"id":"48c6bd62556aaf70","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 为公理集合，$g$ 为固定有效 Gödel 编号；见 [[67-df-sentence]]、[[67-df-godel-encoding]]。"},{"id":"b488bd715fda08a1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"31b7e1fe9d49615e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"650dc4b8018183d7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L_A$、$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$、句子和公式取 [[67-df-godel-encoding]]、[[67-df-sentence]]；固定 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的 $g=c_{L_A}$，句子识别、公式构造与序列操作均为原始递归。"},{"id":"f78588027495114a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Pi_1$ 是 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]] 的公式类；$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 见 [[67-df-sentence]]。"},{"id":"74fe2bcb840f383c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$；句子与外部可推导性见 [[67-df-sentence]]、[[67-df-prim-provability]]。以下命题公式是元层有限带标签树；标签 $0,1,2$ 分别区分变量、否定、合取构造。$p_n,N(P),C(P,Q),H_j,\\mathrm{Prop}$ 在 Assertion 中定义。"},{"id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据